{"t":"PLUG","made":"2026-11-24 14:32","name":"Plug Power Inc.","ko":null,"sector":"Industrials","industry":"Electrical Equipment & Parts","employees":2344,"hq":"Slingerlands, NY, United States","website":"https://www.plugpower.com","summary_en":"Plug Power Inc. designs, develops, and sells hydrogen products and solutions in Europe, Australia, North America, and internationally. The company offers GenDrive, a hydrogen fueled PEM fuel cell system, which powers material handling EVs, including Class 1, 2, 3 and 6 electric forklifts, automated guided vehicles, and ground support equipment; GenFuel, a liquid hydrogen fueling, delivery, generation, storage, and dispensing system; and GenCare, an Internet of Things based maintenance and on-site service program. It also provides GenKey, a turn-key solution; GenEco electrolyzers for clean hydrogen production; liquefaction systems; cryogenic equipment, such as trailers and mobile storage equipment for the distribution of liquified hydrogen, oxygen, argon, nitrogen, and other cryogenic gases; GenSure, a stationary fuel cell solution; and liquid hydrogen. The company serves customers in material handling operations, fuel cell electric vehicle fleets, and stationary power applications through its direct sales force, original equipment manufacturers, and dealer networks. Plug Power Inc. was incorporated in 1997 and is based in Slingerlands, New York.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Plug Power Inc.는 유럽, 호주, 북미 및 국제적으로 수소 제품과 솔루션을 설계, 개발 및 판매합니다. 이 회사는 클래스 1, 2, 3, 6 전기 지게차, 자동 유도 차량 및 지상 지원 장비를 포함하여 자재 취급 EV에 전력을 공급하는 수소 연료 PEM 연료 전지 시스템인 GenDrive를 제공합니다. 액체 수소 연료 공급, 전달, 생성, 저장 및 분배 시스템인 GenFuel; 사물 인터넷 기반 유지 관리 및 현장 서비스 프로그램인 GenCare가 있습니다. 또한 턴키 솔루션인 GenKey도 제공합니다. 깨끗한 수소 생산을 위한 GenEco 전해조; 액화 시스템; 액화수소, 산소, 아르곤, 질소 및 기타 극저온 가스의 분배를 위한 트레일러 및 이동식 저장 장비와 같은 극저온 장비; 고정형 연료전지 솔루션인 GenSure; 그리고 액체수소. 이 회사는 직접 영업 인력, OEM 및 딜러 네트워크를 통해 자재 취급 작업, 연료 전지 전기 차량 및 고정 전력 애플리케이션 분야의 고객에게 서비스를 제공합니다. Plug Power Inc.는 1997년에 설립되었으며 뉴욕주 Slingerlands에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":0.9936,"mcap":1389919104.0,"pe":null,"fpe":-6.997183,"peg":null,"ps":1.8106534,"pb":1.9675248,"ev_ebitda":-6.056,"div":0.0,"beta":2.147,"hi52":4.33,"lo52":0.95},"fin":{"rev":767633984.0,"rev_g":0.133,"eps_g":null,"gross":-0.09821,"op":-0.49740002,"net":-1.53682,"roe":-1.12369,"fcf":-296936512.0,"cash":144331008.0,"debt":888483008.0,"de":124.896,"eps":-0.97,"feps":-0.142},"own":{"short":0.22639999,"inst":0.64584,"insider":0.045149997},"analyst":{"n":15,"mean":2.96667,"median":3.0,"high":7.0,"low":0.75,"rec":"hold","recMean":2.78947,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":0,"buy":5,"hold":11,"sell":3,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":0,"buy":5,"hold":11,"sell":3,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":0,"buy":5,"hold":12,"sell":3,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":0,"buy":5,"hold":12,"sell":3,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-11","Firm":"Susquehanna","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":1.5,"priorPriceTarget":1.75},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-10","Firm":"RBC Capital","ToGrade":"Sector Perform","FromGrade":"Sector Perform","Action":"reit","priceTargetAction":"Maintains","currentPriceTarget":2.0,"priorPriceTarget":2.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-10","Firm":"HC Wainwright & Co.","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"reit","priceTargetAction":"Maintains","currentPriceTarget":7.0,"priorPriceTarget":7.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-14","Firm":"Susquehanna","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":1.75,"priorPriceTarget":2.5},{"GradeDate":"2026-09-29","Firm":"HC Wainwright & Co.","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"reit","priceTargetAction":"Maintains","currentPriceTarget":7.0,"priorPriceTarget":7.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-08-12","Firm":"Roth Capital","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"reit","priceTargetAction":"Raises","